    "detailed_description": "**<strong>Game Story</strong>**<br><br>A baby hedgehog living in a small forest enters an animal academy.<br>The baby hedgehog meets the 8 animal masters at the animal academy.<br>Defeat the monsters in 10 minutes for baby hedgehog to graduate from animal academy.<br><br>**<strong>Features</strong>**<br><br>- 9 weapons with animal characteristics<br>- Various skills to feel the power of the animal masters<br>- The tension and thrill you can feel in 10 minutes of survival<br>- Various drop items to help you survive for 10 minutes<br>- Various monsters appearing in 4 stages<br><br>**<strong>Play Guide</strong>**<br><br>1. Earn coins through gameplay.<br>2. Use the coins to get a perk to borrow the power of animal masters.<br>3. Defeat more monsters in 10 minutes with a baby hedgehog that has been strengthened through the perk.",
    "about_the_game": "**<strong>Game Story</strong>**<br><br>A baby hedgehog living in a small forest enters an animal academy.<br>The baby hedgehog meets the 8 animal masters at the animal academy.<br>Defeat the monsters in 10 minutes for baby hedgehog to graduate from animal academy.<br><br>**<strong>Features</strong>**<br><br>- 9 weapons with animal characteristics<br>- Various skills to feel the power of the animal masters<br>- The tension and thrill you can feel in 10 minutes of survival<br>- Various drop items to help you survive for 10 minutes<br>- Various monsters appearing in 4 stages<br><br>**<strong>Play Guide</strong>**<br><br>1. Earn coins through gameplay.<br>2. Use the coins to get a perk to borrow the power of animal masters.<br>3. Defeat more monsters in 10 minutes with a baby hedgehog that has been strengthened through the perk.",
